WEBVTT

00:00:11.513 --> 00:00:12.514
(squawking)

00:00:14.516 --> 00:00:16.184
(panting)

00:00:16.268 --> 00:00:18.186
(grunts) Look at that! I got an egg.

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:20.105
How many eggs did you poach,
little brother?

00:00:20.188 --> 00:00:21.773
Do we have to steal other creatures' eggs?

00:00:21.857 --> 00:00:23.442
I mean, couldn't we just go vegan?

00:00:23.525 --> 00:00:25.152
Sure, we could eat vegans.

00:00:25.235 --> 00:00:27.195
-(grunts)
-Whoops! Oh-oh-oh!

00:00:27.279 --> 00:00:31.199
(grunts) Son, sometimes I wonder
how you snuck into this family.

00:00:31.283 --> 00:00:32.492
BUCK:
♪ Figaro, Figaro ♪

00:00:32.576 --> 00:00:36.371
-(all gasp)
-♪ Figaro, Figaro, Figaro ♪

00:00:36.455 --> 00:00:39.708
With you in a minute.
I'll have to rinse and repeat.

00:00:39.791 --> 00:00:42.502
(grunts) That weasel is such a buzzkill.

00:00:42.586 --> 00:00:44.046
Let's go, kids.

00:00:44.129 --> 00:00:45.380
Don't worry, ma'am.

00:00:45.464 --> 00:00:47.215
I'll catch the crew that poached your egg.

00:00:47.299 --> 00:00:48.842
(slurps and exhales)

00:00:48.925 --> 00:00:50.469
(laughs) It's a pun!

00:00:50.552 --> 00:00:52.137
I'm winking under the eye patch.

00:00:53.889 --> 00:00:57.059
♪ A mother is crying
A damsel in distress ♪

00:00:57.434 --> 00:01:00.896
♪ Foreboding intruders
Have made such a mess ♪

00:01:00.979 --> 00:01:02.648
♪ What I detect is a lack of respect ♪

00:01:02.731 --> 00:01:04.107
♪ For all that is precious and dear ♪

00:01:04.608 --> 00:01:07.736
♪ I am the pint-sized protector
Of this lost world ♪

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:10.280
But my friends call me Buck.

00:01:10.947 --> 00:01:12.491
Well played, guys.

00:01:12.574 --> 00:01:13.659
(grunts)

00:01:13.742 --> 00:01:16.703
♪ I have a message, bullies not welcome ♪

00:01:16.787 --> 00:01:18.038
♪ Return what you've stolen ♪

00:01:18.121 --> 00:01:19.581
♪ Go back where you came from ♪

00:01:19.665 --> 00:01:21.667
(vocalizing)

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.210
♪ You know I'm greater, so don't be a hater ♪

00:01:23.293 --> 00:01:25.087
♪ You may be Jurassic, but I am fantastic ♪

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:29.716
(echoing) ♪ Figaro, Figaro
Figaro, Figaro, Figaro, Figaro ♪

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:32.969
♪ Figaro ♪

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:35.389
-Oh, love that bit.
-(growling)

00:01:35.472 --> 00:01:36.848
♪ Running and climbing
And spinning and grinning ♪

00:01:36.932 --> 00:01:38.016
♪ And dashing and diving and dodging ♪

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.393
♪ And sliding and gliding and staying alive ♪

00:01:39.476 --> 00:01:40.519
♪ And these are a few of the things ♪

00:01:40.602 --> 00:01:41.561
♪ That I do before lunch ♪

00:01:41.645 --> 00:01:43.897
♪ Death defying
Danger denying ♪

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:45.357
♪ Look, I'm flying ♪

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:47.734
♪ You might think I'm mad
But, hey, you only live once ♪

00:01:47.818 --> 00:01:49.736
♪ No need to thank me ♪

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:51.905
♪ But if you insist, I won't resist ♪

00:01:51.988 --> 00:01:54.116
♪ Who smells like fish? ♪

00:01:54.199 --> 00:01:56.243
-ALL: Huh? (sniffing)
-Hold on to your butts!

00:01:56.326 --> 00:01:57.327
♪ Class ♪

00:01:59.454 --> 00:02:01.206
(all screaming)

00:02:04.710 --> 00:02:08.004
♪ Dismissed ♪

00:02:09.881 --> 00:02:10.924
(slurps and exhales)

00:02:11.007 --> 00:02:12.217
Good egg.

00:02:14.136 --> 00:02:15.345
(triceratops bleating)

00:02:19.015 --> 00:02:20.392
Here you are, my lady.

00:02:20.475 --> 00:02:21.727
(gasps)

00:02:22.894 --> 00:02:24.146
(chuckles)

00:02:25.814 --> 00:02:26.898
Huh?

00:02:26.982 --> 00:02:28.984
Go! I'll lead them away.

00:02:30.736 --> 00:02:31.737
(grunts)

00:02:32.988 --> 00:02:34.406
Oh, that was fun!

00:02:34.489 --> 00:02:36.658
Same time, same place, next week?

00:02:36.742 --> 00:02:38.827
Toodles! (laughing)

00:02:39.327 --> 00:02:41.621
Congratulations, weasel.

00:02:41.705 --> 00:02:44.583
You just signed your death warrant.

00:02:46.418 --> 00:02:48.754
Weaseled my way out of that one.

00:02:49.087 --> 00:02:51.840
Hmm. What's all that
flash and dazzle about?

00:02:51.923 --> 00:02:52.966
Oh!

00:02:53.049 --> 00:02:55.510
Who puts a rock in the middle of the jungle?

00:02:55.594 --> 00:02:56.845
Ow! (grunting)

00:02:59.514 --> 00:03:00.682
(Buck screaming)

00:03:05.937 --> 00:03:06.938
Mmm.

00:03:10.066 --> 00:03:11.067
Ooh.

00:03:11.568 --> 00:03:12.569
(panting)

00:03:20.368 --> 00:03:21.369
Ha!

00:03:22.537 --> 00:03:23.538
(sniffs)

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:29.795
Blimey!

00:03:30.712 --> 00:03:32.380
What is this place?

00:03:37.719 --> 00:03:38.804
(creaking)

00:03:38.887 --> 00:03:39.888
Whoops!

00:03:55.487 --> 00:03:56.863
Hmm.

00:03:56.947 --> 00:03:57.948
(gasps)

00:04:14.923 --> 00:04:16.925
(both grunting)

